{
    "title": "Connection: Logic Games",
    "description": "Connection is the ultimate logic game for Brain Training. Your goal is simple: connect all the dots.\r\n\r\nConnection stands out as a great time-killer; it\u2019s relaxing because each level is quick to solve, but also incredibly addictive thanks to carefully designed FX and SFX that provide a satisfying ASMR effect and a top-notch anti-stress experience. If you\u2019re looking for <b>Logic Games</b> that also serve as Brain Training, this game is a perfect match.\r\n\r\nConnection offers:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Simple and Stress-Relief Friendly: Connect dots that share the same color and fill the empty dots to pass the minimalist puzzle levels. This Logic Game is designed to be a seamless Brain Training experience.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Beautiful: The connection between minimalistic stylized design and a soothing soundtrack will be highly appealing to your senses. This is one of the Logic Games that truly combines aesthetics with Brain Training.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Strategic: Free of time-limit rules, Connection allows you to build your own strategy and link dots at your pace. It\u2019s not just a Logic Game; it\u2019s a thoughtful Brain Training exercise.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Fun: Level after level, you will find yourself wrapped in an immersive and enjoyable gameplay environment, proving that Brain Training can be both engaging and entertaining in Logic Games.\r\n\r\nDo you like our work? Connect below:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Listen to our stories: https://www.instagram.com/8infinitygames/\r\n\u2022 Learn more about us: https://www.infinitygames.io/\r\n\u2022 Show us your love: https://www.facebook.com/infinitygamespage\r\n\u2022 Follow our steps: https://twitter.com/8infinitygames\r\n\r\nNote: This game is also available on Wear OS. And it\u2019s very fun as well!",
